== Overview ==
The '''Toxic Barrel Toilet''' is a toilet that explodes and stuns units in an AoE circle, the stun of this toilet is stronger than [[Explosive Flying Toilet]].
== Appearance ==
The '''Toxic Barrel Toilet''' has two acid barrels alongside a jetpack.
== Waves ==
Wave ??? (mostly on nightmare or christmas mode)
== Strategy ==
'''Toxic Barrel Toilet''' works similarly to the [[Explosive Flying Toilet|explosive flying toilet]]. It's best to use ranged units to defeat it before stunning. If not, use [[Medic Cameraman|medic cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone|camera repair drone]] to unstun units.

You can use any money farm like [[Santa TV Man]] to attract this toilet since stunned money farm still give you money.

== Trivia ==
*It is similar to the explosive flying toilet but stronger

